{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14205","headline":"中秋夜登楼望月寄人 · 戎昱","name":"中秋夜登楼望月寄人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西楼见月似江城，脉脉悠悠倚槛情。\n万里此情同皎洁，一年今日最分明。\n初惊桂子从天落，稍误芦花带雪平。\n知称玉人临水见，可怜光彩有余清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}